The '''S.S. Prime Treasure''' (Japanese: '''プライム・トレジャー{{tt|号|ごう}}''' ''Prime Treasure'') is a luxury cruise ship in the game {{OBP|Detective Pikachu|video game}}. It is visiting [[Ryme City]] to observe the annual [[Pokémon Carnival]]. Most of Chapter 8 takes place here.

